{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/13887-changeling-the-lost-clarification-on-seeming-creation","id":13887,"title":"Changeling the Lost, clarification on Seeming creation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-19T02:32:31-08:00","id":13887,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Changeling the Lost, clarification on Seeming creation","content":"I had this crazy idea for a Changeling game that focuses on a Seeming concept of the Sandmen. I got the idea rather ironically from a dream i had. Is it too out of the box to design a new seeming? Can I get some rules guidelines to flesh this concept out? I already have several ideas for different Sandmen kiths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1214-maltesemindtrick","name":"MalteseMindTrick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T08:22:31-08:00","id":14063,"title":"","content":"While creating a new Seeming isn't impossible, it does seem unlikely to be necessary. &quot;Sandmen&quot; isn't as broad a concept as the others seem to be. Why are you thinking of them as a Seeming instead of a Kith?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T09:28:40-08:00","id":14100,"title":"","content":"Yeah I can see it fitting easily with the Fairest, Wizened, Elemental and Darkling Seemings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T15:12:52-08:00","id":14318,"title":"","content":"Posibly a Darkling, their favoured Contracts of Night wil help with the concept of a sandman.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T15:32:15-08:00","id":14331,"title":"","content":"Aye, I agree with everyone. Nothing stops you from making a new Seeming; if you decide to do so, I'm sure we'd all be interested to see what you make in that vein. Definitely a cool direction to go.<br /> <br /> However, you might consider introducing it as a new Kith for an existing Seeming; it would be a bit less work at that. Or, as you mentioned having a number of ideas, possibly multiple Kiths across several Seemings. There's probably enough material there to fit all of them; I'm not sure what to do with Ogre, but in addition to the four suggested, maybe something like a dream-eating <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baku_%28spirit%29\" target=\"_blank\">Baku</a> for Beast?<br /> <br /> Anyway, if you want to go with your original idea of making a new Seeming, go for it. I haven't seen many fan-made Seemings. Regrettably, I'm not savvy enough to give any advice beyond just looking at the six Seeming write-ups as examples and go from there.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, Thorbes: your signature is pretty rocking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":". 11-19-2013, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}